The isolated build disables GPL, nonfree, version3, network, programs and
external autodetection. Selected libavformat/libavcodec/libavutil/libswscale/
libswresample components are LGPL-2.1-or-later; LICENSE contains LGPL 2.1.
No upstream sources are modified. tools/build_suite_media_dependencies.py
records the exact configure invocation and downloads/checks the corresponding
source archive. Binaries and model weights are not vendored in this repository.
Binary redistributors must preserve the notices, provide corresponding source
and allow replacement/relinking of the shared LGPL libraries.

The C wrapper uses custom memory AVIO and denies external resource opening.
FFmpeg performs decode and pixel/sample-format conversion, never inference.
